To obtain R: c = varrho / (1 - alpha_hat) using the margin and
cert_alpha_q05 from the training CSV, then
    R = (c + L_V * D) / kappa1_linear_slope
with L_V the spectral bound if certifying in the latent, or
L_V_soc_maxslope with D_soc if certifying in SoC alone.

Report kappa1_linear_slope as an ESTIMATE: a per-bin minimum
over finitely many samples is biased above the true infimum,
so the fitted slope is optimistic and R correspondingly small.
